WEBVTT

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:20.870
We've really been through a lot haven't we so many many things had your fair share of pathetic moments at the start

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:29.890
Often being the butt of people's jokes even after you grew a little stronger someone tougher was always standing in your way

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.680
It was a constant ordeal. Hardly a day went by when you weren't injured. There were some rough times.

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:45.660
Moments I thought you might break down. Even moments I feared you would be swallowed by despair.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:53.020
Moments it looked like you were down for the count. But you never stopped wishing for it. Ever.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:59.980
Wishing to be a hero. Wishing to be stronger. You kept...

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:07.800
it over and over, striving to reach your goal, to keep on fighting, to uphold your promises.

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:16.420
You surmounted countless adversities, and now just look at how far you've come.

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:53.070
Congrats, Belle. Good job. You've ranked up again. The black minotaur that you fought, was it really strong?

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:59.970
Very. Belle fought through the battle-

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:01.970
Kenosis and protected the Xenos.

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:07.320
Generally speaking, that feat alone could have made him worthy enough for a rank up.

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:12.920
But to be honest, it was his defeat that was the most meaningful.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:19.000
The frustration that he felt is actually what pushed Belle's status to the next stage.

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:29.960
Don't worry about...

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:33.040
Seeing you in this moment just made me feel like saying that.

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:36.770
It's just a symbol of all the things that I preside over.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:40.340
And a title, too. And another name that I go by.

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:43.610
Your name's, uh, Vesta?

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:47.600
Mm-hmm. It has the meaning of perpetual flame.

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:59.280
I take it your injuries have all healed clean, Belcranel.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.540
They have. Thanks again.

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:08.440
I hear that you have reached level four, and I see the expression on your face has changed a great deal.

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:09.750
You think so?

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:14.540
Indeed. Although that is coming from someone who has no eyes.

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:18.590
Tell me, have you decided what your next course of action will be?

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:25.370
Yes. I'm going to start exploring the dungeon again, to get stronger.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:28.720
It sounds as though you are committed.

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:29.970
How else?

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.530
I detect a slight hesitation under the surface

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:38.110
Until the deepest level of the dungeon is conquered

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:41.490
Coexistence between humanity and the Xenos is impossible

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:45.100
It matters not how much Uranus and I strive to help

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:49.980
The future we wish for will never come as long as that feat remains unaccomplished

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:56.820
If you want to act with the Xenos' best interest at heart, then please push forward Belkanel

00:03:56.820 --> 00:03:59.970
Tell me honestly, set the-

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:09.790
bottom of the dungeon a covenant forged long ago as well as a conclusion dear miss aina i

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:15.320
luvis shall now gallantly venture down to the lower floors of the dungeon and resolve a quest

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:19.870
shut up you're interrupting our precious personal time before i go save the day

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:25.080
aina my dearest i'll bring you a nice gift from the lower floors after i complete my quest

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:29.180
don't even try it you smelly dwarf you won't even get past the front gates

00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:29.980
stuff it in your

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.540
Pointy ear, you stupid elf! You'll get whatever's left over when I'm all finished up!

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:36.620
Pardon me, uh, Mr. Luvis and Mr. Dormel?

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:42.040
Quests on the lower floors can be especially dangerous for adventurers, so I wish you a safe journey!

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:42.820
Oh!

00:04:43.160 --> 00:04:44.860
Thank you so much, Ana, my love!

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:47.380
Come on! She was clearly talking to me, you trashy-

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:49.060
Say that again and I'll break your pointy nose!

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:49.820
Try it!

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:50.920
Well, hello, though!

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:51.980
Huh?

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:54.620
Wait, is that who I think it is?

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:56.720
It's the little rookie.

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:59.970
Oh, uh, sorry. I'm happy to wait if you're in the middle-

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.100
of something. It's fine! I'm the one who asked you to come!

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:11.990
Hi! Here you go. What the? Is that what I think it is?

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.550
Wait, what?! She giving him a love letter?!

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:17.360
Miss Aina, isn't this, uh...

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:22.340
It is! It's an official one this time. A directive for the Hestia Familia, straight from the guild.

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:29.980
Is another mission already? It's where we just...

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:35.840
Done handling all that Zeno stuff and here they come dumping another compulsory mission on our heads the nerve of them

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:39.560
I mean, what do you really expect that was all done under the table?

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:45.150
I suppose we could always look on the bright side of things though our familiar strong enough to be considered for missions

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:49.140
Although it's mainly thanks to master bell. Oh, booey

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:53.280
I wouldn't have registered us for an exploration if I knew they'd give us this crap

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:59.450
I figured it was the best choice since the application process was easy and people said we get all sorts of preferential treatment

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:09.930
But this does kind of work out perfectly, right, Belle?

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:12.130
Yeah, this will work out nicely.

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:14.150
I wanted to go back to the dungeon anyway.

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:17.910
And wouldn't you know it, I've already whipped up new equipment for the whole team.

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:19.940
The guild didn't even have to bother.

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:21.360
We are good to go.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.740
The mission itself is about what you would expect.

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:26.610
We have to go down and break our previous floor record,

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:29.370
and then return with the number of items that they requested.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:34.620
Seems like a standard expedition, but that does leave us with some options.

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:38.890
Either we simply accomplish the goals they've given us, or do more.

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:43.050
Personally, I want to press further on.

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:45.480
I want to do it for Vina and the Senos.

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:47.120
And for our own benefit.

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:48.760
I want us all to get stronger.

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.040
That settles that.

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:56.720
Great, then we should reach out to Take and Miyak to provide some back.

00:06:57.550 --> 00:06:58.890
We will form a united front.

00:06:59.290 --> 00:06:59.970
A united...

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:12.640
huh? If you say so. This isn't just a mission, it's an expedition to gain some strength. So the more allies, the better. We're all going to press on together, right? Then let's make it happen. Sound good?

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:25.500
Oh yeah! I see. An expedition, eh? Yes. And as a member of the Hestia Familia, I am here to humbly request your support.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:29.980
Despite the clear risks that are involved, I have no objections to offering Hestia Familia.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:34.580
assistants in this case what are the two of you think about it I feel exactly the

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:39.160
same plus we owe them a debt that we haven't fully paid back yet same for me

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:44.720
I would very much like to accompany you both mm-hmm in which case it's best to

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:51.520
be fully prepared care for a round or two been a while since we last barred sure

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:57.060
all right which members of the meoc familia can join us on the expedition

00:07:57.060 --> 00:07:59.530
mmm Cassandra and myself

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:04.300
Our captain said she's going to provide logistical support, like securing items and such.

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:07.540
Sounds good. So how should we fit you into the formation?

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:08.900
Hmm.

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:13.800
Well, back when I was in the Apollo Familia, I did odd jobs in the middle guard.

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:15.340
Cassandra should go to the rear guard.

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:17.670
Since she's a healer, she'll be best there.

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:20.690
And you can bet she's going to be way more useful than I am.

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:23.610
Oh my gosh, that's mighty kind of you to say, Daphne.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:25.390
Now, don't get all blushy about it.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:29.000
Is that a list of everyone who's going to be in the party?

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:29.580
That's right.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:34.940
In addition to our usual members, we have Oka and Chigusa, given to us by Master Takami

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:35.520
Kazuchi.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:37.660
And Lady Aisha, too.

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:39.150
Not THAT Aisha!

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:43.550
As in Aisha Belka, former member of Ishtar Familia!

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:44.690
Auntie Inera?

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:45.760
Uh-huh.

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:50.590
I don't know how she found out, but she suddenly came marching up to our door recently.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:51.670
So!

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:53.930
I hear you're going on an expedition.

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:56.390
You guys should take me with you.

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:59.980
We had no reason to refi-

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:05.890
So we wound up adding her to the roster, but with a battle formation that includes two level fours

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:10.070
The discussion shifted to how easily we could pass the middle floors and go deeper into the dungeon

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:15.090
I figured it would be like that. It would be a waste to form a huge party for something simple

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:15.770
That's right

00:09:15.770 --> 00:09:19.730
And the plan was always to adventure as far as we possibly could of course

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:27.740
That makes things difficult for you a level one supporter will be the first one to die once we hit the lower levels

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:33.440
Whatever, why not? I'm just telling the truth.

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:38.610
But if she insists on coming along no matter what, then we'll just have to find a compromise somehow.

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:42.740
Well, you're not going to fight. Instead, issue orders.

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:47.480
You'll help guide the battle while being safe in the rearguard. Basically a strategist.

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:51.660
I'm not fond of the role because I was forced into it a few times,

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:56.040
but having someone in the back who keeps track of the bigger picture is really important.

00:09:59.560 --> 00:09:59.960
Did I?

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:04.620
Yep, exactly what Finn of the Loki Familia does.

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:08.660
Except, everybody knows that he's also ridiculously strong.

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:14.240
During the war games, I got frustrated when you totally outwitted us.

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:16.580
I think you've got the talent for it.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:20.710
And if you're willing to try, I'll teach you all the basics that you need to know.

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:43.560
foolish some say the majority of adventurers are too preoccupied with their status i tend to agree

00:10:43.650 --> 00:10:48.290
even someone with a normal physique like me can compete with you on an equal level just by

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:55.580
mastering martial arts it comes down to techniques and tactics status doesn't improve things in a

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:59.470
single day however techniques and tactics too

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:13.350
Yep. That being said, don't expect to master techniques with ease. You will need energy, and effort, and conviction to see things through to the end. Only then do you stand a chance of pulling it off.

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:26.310
I see. Makes sense. What I desire is technique that can oppose the powerful and demand strength to help us survive adventures.

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:27.260
Mm-hmm.

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:29.140
Well then, Mikoto, Chigusa...

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.180
You should learn exactly that.

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:35.020
By unleashing your techniques with proper timing and proper breath control,

00:11:35.890 --> 00:11:40.280
you can hurl even the heaviest of giants and slice through the hardest of bodies.

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:44.360
You have both grown beyond who you were back in the Far East.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:46.140
Get ready.

00:11:47.070 --> 00:11:49.830
I shall give you a lesson on what I could never teach you back then.

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:06.910
Well, hey there, big fella. What can I do for you?

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:12.580
Mikoto told us about your expedition. Chigusa and I will be joining you.

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:15.310
You came just to tell me that?

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:23.650
No, I wanted to talk to you. This is new territory for us, too. I would like to prepare however I can.

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:27.520
So what? You want me to coach you or something?

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.120
Won't do much good.

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:29.880
Yes.

00:12:30.732 --> 00:12:31.352
I know that.

00:12:31.788 --> 00:12:32.748
I'm a blacksmith.

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:37.740
And right now, I'm helping my friends by making sure they're armed with the highest quality equipment.

00:12:38.412 --> 00:12:40.192
I'm already doing everything I can.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:42.140
So I don't have time to waste.

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:42.980
I need a weapon.

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:47.380
And I would like for you to make it for me.

00:12:48.332 --> 00:12:48.652
Please.

00:12:50.796 --> 00:12:51.996
And I want the real deal.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:55.280
A weapon I can use to keep Chigusa and Haruhibe safe.

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:02.430
Well, I'm good, but I'm very expensive.

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:05.080
How about a discount?

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:06.000
Gah!

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:07.820
Son of a-

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:13.110
Pardon?

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:14.870
Miss Aisha?

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:16.760
Hm.

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:20.780
What we are doing?

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:24.110
Why did you close everything up?

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:27.690
That should be quite obvious, Haruhime.

00:13:32.044 --> 00:13:33.004
I'm putting you through.

00:13:33.356 --> 00:13:35.356
a special drill.

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.500
What is she talking about?

00:13:38.572 --> 00:13:39.652
Special help!

00:13:40.076 --> 00:13:40.856
You heard me.

00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:44.420
You are the biggest pushover out of everyone who's going on the expedition.

00:13:44.972 --> 00:13:46.192
You know that, don't you?

00:13:46.892 --> 00:13:47.892
Awwww!

00:13:50.988 --> 00:13:54.288
If you can only provide one level boost, you're honestly going to be a burden.

00:13:55.116 --> 00:13:55.916
Maybe true.

00:13:56.364 --> 00:13:59.664
However, I don't have the ability to fight like Mikoto and all the others.

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:02.830
Nobody is expecting a sorcerer to start throwing punches.

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:04.750
Casting magic is your talent.

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:07.370
Okay, so should I refine my magic?

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:08.540
Not quite.

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:11.350
You are going to learn a new magic instead.

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:12.550
Oh, but...

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.220
Magic is a complicated and time-consuming process.

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:22.250
Well, we're going to take the easy route and force it out.

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:23.870
What is that?

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:26.080
It's a grimoire.

00:14:31.244 --> 00:14:32.244
The Great Falls.

00:14:33.004 --> 00:14:36.544
It's a gigantic waterfall that's located on the first of the lower floors.

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:37.860
The 25th.

00:14:38.508 --> 00:14:41.648
It continues down through multiple levels and ends on the 27th.

00:14:43.596 --> 00:14:44.456
Is that so?

00:14:44.748 --> 00:14:45.828
You're amazing, Belle.

00:14:46.088 --> 00:14:46.268
Huh?

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:51.500
Most people I know prepare to explore new floors by brushing up on their battle strategies, but-

00:14:52.108 --> 00:14:56.728
Here you are spending time gathering up information like it's not even a big deal for you.

00:14:57.452 --> 00:14:57.832
Mm-hmm.

00:14:57.996 --> 00:14:59.956
It's just like your first-class adventure.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:07.980
I realized something. The true meaning behind all the lessons you've given me.

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:13.060
This knowledge is vital. It could be exactly what keeps our party safe on a new floor.

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:16.850
And so, I'm trying to do everything I can to prepare myself.

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:18.810
Belle.

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:23.420
Only a few months have passed since we first met each other.

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:26.480
He's really grown up.

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:29.960
His admiration for Lady Wallenstein...

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.440
has gradually led him to new heights.

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:34.050
Now he can even fight against powerful monsters

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:35.210
like that Minotaur.

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:39.020
I don't have it in me to ask any of the details,

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:43.170
but it's crazy how much people like him change.

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:44.970
And in such a short time,

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:52.800
Miss Aena? Huh? Yes, what is it? I'm curious about the monsters that appear in this area near the Great Falls.

00:15:53.230 --> 00:15:59.960
Um, the most dangerous one is this. A flying monster known as Iguazu. It's recommended to be killed by a flying monster.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.960
that you flee at all costs, even if that means

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:04.120
ditching your belongings. This is bad.

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:06.190
That thing's extremely deadly, Belle.

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:08.290
I think I may be

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:09.350
falling head over heels.

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:11.880
Hear me out.

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:15.400
Don't know how to describe it, but I get this

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:17.260
feeling some sort of bittersweet aura

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:19.320
is encroaching on Belle right now.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.160
Or maybe it's the hooch.

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.290
Definitely that. Indeed.

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:24.870
Forget it and drink up.

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:28.140
Again, I'm really grateful you agreed to work with us

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:29.880
on the expedition. Thanks, Taki.

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:32.310
Tumiyak and Hephaestus.

00:16:32.890 --> 00:16:33.990
Don't mention it, Hestia.

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:35.080
I'm glad to.

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.990
Anything to help out a good friend like you, of course.

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:38.790
I agree.

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:42.080
Besides, we'll be asking you for help in return eventually.

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:43.800
It's give and take.

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:49.370
As you requested, I'll send some blacksmiths over to watch your home for you.

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:52.560
All I did was mention they could see Wealth's workshop, you know.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:54.580
Then I was up to my neck and volunteers.

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:55.540
It was funny.

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:56.820
I appreciate it.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:59.960
Otherwise, I'd be stuck at home and wouldn't be able to go to work.

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:06.230
No kidding. But asking me to provide house-sitters so you can repay your debt doesn't really balance out.

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:12.970
But I must say, I'm honestly a little bit embarrassed being here.

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:17.500
We're drinking at a bar, leaving the prep to our children. That's not very fair, is it?

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:21.470
What's to do? They're on top of everything!

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:24.140
Oh, Hestia.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:29.970
I can relate. Why, today, I just learned. Those in my familia have really...

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:35.340
grown. They gave me some bruises to prove it. Naza has also made great strides in improving

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:39.860
her pharmaceutical mixing skills. She seemed very keen on developing a new potion before

00:17:39.860 --> 00:17:44.520
the expedition, for Belle's sake. Guess all kids grow up, and they need less and less of

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:50.540
my help. It's a very sweet reality, isn't it? Why the long face, Estia? Let me guess,

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:59.970
you're feeling lonely? Oh, of course I wouldn't be lonely. Sure, but you must.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.700
be equally as proud of them, right?

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:05.200
Yeah! You're totally right on that, Hephaistus!

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:08.360
I don't know if it's called happiness, or maybe it's called pride,

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:11.140
but it makes my heart feel all warm and fuzzy!

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:16.240
Belle used to be such a crybaby, and now he's turned into a super cool and super brave hero!

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:17.520
A real dignified-

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:22.020
I'm falling for him all over again! My heart's all on flutter!

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:40.290
To be honest, I'm not without my concerns about the expedition.

00:18:41.570 --> 00:18:44.650
After all, Belle and the others are doing it to bolster their strength.

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:50.050
This is hard to say after we invited your children to join us, but it's going to be risky.

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:53.820
Even so, I have faith.

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:55.520
Belle can do it.

00:18:55.680 --> 00:18:59.200
I know my familia has what it takes to rise to the challenge.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:01.800
Indeed. They're a talented bunch.

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:04.760
Yes, I am certain that they will.

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:06.910
They're going to be just fine.

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:12.190
Alrighty, let's do a successful adventure for our children!

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:13.320
Cheers!

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:37.740
Master Welp is asking if we can wait longer!

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:41.160
Huh, seriously? I told him to be here on the dot!

00:19:42.050 --> 00:19:44.150
What about Lady Daphne and Lady Cassandra?

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:48.900
They're coming. They were busy arguing about something this morning, so we left before them.

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:51.380
They should be here just about any moment now.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:52.840
Hope you're right.

00:19:53.570 --> 00:19:57.230
What a complete mess. We're having trouble before the expedition begins.

00:19:57.840 --> 00:19:59.980
And here I thought I would be the last one here-

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.700
rushed all this way for nothing.

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:03.020
My apologies.

00:20:03.480 --> 00:20:04.600
Sorry we're late.

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:07.050
I'm so sorry.

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:08.730
You two all right?

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:10.670
You're not gonna believe it.

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:15.130
The big day finally comes and Cassandra suddenly tells me she doesn't want to go anymore.

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:18.070
Well, there's a reason. I had another dream.

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:22.280
This disgusting green moss was trying to swallow up a ton of people.

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:25.090
So, please consider it.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:28.820
Can we cancel or perhaps postpone the expedition?

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:34.530
Uh, no can do. I'm sorry.

00:20:35.180 --> 00:20:36.860
I figured as much.

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:43.160
Please, we know we're bound to run into trouble. It's expected.

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:45.990
But isn't that what an adventurer is all about?

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:50.200
Sorry, guys. Everybody ready?

00:20:57.600 --> 00:20:59.890
Is this it? The weapon I asked for?

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:04.100
Yeah, better earn enough on this expedition to pay it off.

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:09.300
This is a real masterpiece.

00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:11.100
Yeah, damn straight it is.

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:14.240
Belle, this one's for you.

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:17.270
It's a new weapon that I made from Unicorn Horn.

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:18.940
I call it the Hakugen.

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:24.030
Hakugen? So light.

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:28.200
I was working down to the last minute, but definitely one of my best.

00:21:28.840 --> 00:21:29.740
Put it to good use.

00:21:30.570 --> 00:21:32.290
Thank you so much, Wealth.

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:34.460
Okay, everyone.

00:21:34.820 --> 00:21:35.660
It's time to go.

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:37.710
We'll handle things here.

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:38.390
Give them hell.

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:40.560
Be careful out there.

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:42.980
And don't do anything crazy.

00:21:49.930 --> 00:21:52.290
Remember, keep your guard up, okay?

00:21:53.180 --> 00:21:53.640
Will do.

00:21:54.640 --> 00:21:56.630
Give it all you got.

00:21:57.160 --> 00:21:57.480
Right.

00:21:59.730 --> 00:21:59.910
Goodbye.

00:22:19.800 --> 00:22:20.500
PICCUS!

00:22:34.220 --> 00:22:36.190
They just keep coming here I go

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:39.980
Next time, the Great Falls.
